{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_intro_title", "source_sha256": "868310e193d1af0b9a0a16b18d5826a5490fe3f9410defa30dc115829fc1db4a", "ja": "なし", "zh": "无", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_intro_synopsis", "source_sha256": "868310e193d1af0b9a0a16b18d5826a5490fe3f9410defa30dc115829fc1db4a", "ja": "なし", "zh": "无", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_intro_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "995611728484e8f106bdce6cfbe8a6dc6ae5240175c5df46573e762536cf46a4", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さーん！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_intro_1001_p", "source_sha256": "83a59a2aa5ee84653601e1e2232f176a092b1be6f17a8f8294ae61866c30fb16", "ja": "青羽さん、お疲れさまです。\nどうしました？", "zh": "青羽小姐，你辛苦了。\n怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_intro_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "e8c6315b9ce9ae9dfe68ae26904e402f822e2832223cd21c5acfeb92023e455f", "ja": "社長さんがお呼びです。事務所で待ってるって\nおっしゃってたので、行ってみて……。", "zh": "社长正在找你。他说会在事务所等你过去，\n你快去看看吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_intro_1003_102mis", "source_sha256": "e91048c6c3d14b69c476a91903a978e6239339e11f6167200df083687b6268b9", "ja": "あっ、そうだ！　お土産があるんでした！", "zh": "啊，对了！还有伴手礼！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_intro_1004_p", "source_sha256": "2f16130972d28685741fbe9de0a12c698a0b6b7e90b28e5439a7ab5c571ac325", "ja": "うん？　お土産って何のことですか？", "zh": "嗯？伴手礼是指什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_intro_1005_102mis", "source_sha256": "2cd3ccea293d7bb96f2c91011f4c93e0254355be98d67fa719c235526562c971", "ja": "じつはさっき、春香ちゃんがシュークリームをたくさん\n作って、持ってきてくれたんですよ～。えへへっ！", "zh": "其实刚才春香带了很多手工泡芙过来喔～\n嘿嘿！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_intro_1006_102mis", "source_sha256": "40b5cfa88072634540718bedb609d97634c0f8423c1f4e6b2f125c608583401a", "ja": "社長さん達にも食べて欲しいって言ってたので、\nお届けお願いします♪", "zh": "她说也想给社长他们吃，\n请你帮忙送过去吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_intro_1007", "source_sha256": "72581708f4a5c9f944f2121956fbfb746fd61b265cb305e76f64a4a968f4a7f8", "ja": "受け取る", "zh": "收下", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_intro_1040_p", "source_sha256": "8287e64bb85f4b72da3b0699e7c46809aca382476de000af6cd08ff00dccbcd8", "ja": "なるほど。春香のシュークリームは絶品ですからね！\nわかりました、では行ってきます。", "zh": "原来如此，毕竟春香的泡芙是绝品嘛！\n我知道了，我这就过去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_intro_1008_102mis", "source_sha256": "9a25a6f08dea243a5f43328676bc2356231e32bbd4caadfee575902aa0cca076", "ja": "はい、お気をつけて～！\nあ、保冷剤は1時間分ですからね～♪", "zh": "来，请小心拿～！\n啊，保冷剂可以维持一小时喔～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_intro_1009_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_intro_1010_p", "source_sha256": "4d558a9559b7e510631cdcefd25579de4e2969f8839ee20b3a3afaec48be2dc1", "ja": "失礼します。\n社長、音無さん、おはようございます！", "zh": "打扰了。\n社长、音无小姐，早安！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_intro_1011_101kot", "source_sha256": "2adf524817ef0a637ad28e1b454b540da903b08f67c6139e64d2b543b402cf0a", "ja": "おはようございます、\n{$P$}さん。", "zh": "早安，\n{$P$}先生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_intro_1012_president", "source_sha256": "c1bad5d4eb0c3e76778e49583c1fbba69f630476a9c3401564c77626de284b8b", "ja": "おはよう。よくきてくれたね、君！", "zh": "早安，你来得正好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_intro_1013_p", "source_sha256": "870782491b874a77183b60f002ca0a80019372c88e9c5682ffe2bbec378265b4", "ja": "あ、これ、春香からの差し入れです。\n手作りのシュークリームみたいですよ。", "zh": "啊，这是春香送的慰劳品，\n好像是手工泡芙。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_intro_1014_president", "source_sha256": "44815a2707c9e82b54813a68e0b7c889bbde9d88eede76ea6a844cf5735ef455", "ja": "おお、天海君も忙しいというのに……\nなんともありがたいねぇ！", "zh": "喔喔，天海明明也很忙碌……\n真是感激不尽！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_intro_1015_101kot", "source_sha256": "3a0d18ffe53054759bfbc4a179ef55b88d4247b791e7f536d126a59552252fa8", "ja": "わあ、春香ちゃんのシュークリーム、\nすっごくおいしいんですよね♪", "zh": "哇，\n春香做的泡芙非常好吃呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_intro_1016_president", "source_sha256": "2d800b9309907464f0f0c5fcedca7d453d3f3f71db9fbaf92719ceefd16708c8", "ja": "うむ、さっそく、いただこうじゃないか。\nいや、ちょうどお茶請けが欲しかったところなんだよ！", "zh": "嗯，那就马上来品尝吧。\n哎呀，我们也正好想要吃茶点呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_intro_1017_101kot", "source_sha256": "c7762b269c50a0cc9efd4bc75afcdb32fa73474b6015dabc22660577c59168b7", "ja": "はい♪　{$P$}さんも、\nよかったらご一緒にどうぞ……もぐもぐ♪", "zh": "是啊♪{$P$}先生要是不嫌弃，\n也请一起吃吧……（嚼嚼）♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_intro_1018_president", "source_sha256": "9493f079d1ab282b384de72ec58f1960d359d0d720dde833885d4718443b58b2", "ja": "遠慮はいらないからね。モグモグ、モグモグモグ……\nごくん！　うむ、実に美味しかった！", "zh": "你千万别客气。（嚼嚼、嚼嚼嚼……）\n（吞下）嗯，实在是太好吃了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_intro_1019_president", "source_sha256": "42e2bdfda5638c9ecf6c43e8968c8e5c12609db419dd592ef4f79953948540f6", "ja": "天海君に、ありがとうと伝えてくれたまえ。\nでは、お疲れ様！", "zh": "替我跟天海道一声谢。\n好了，辛苦你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_intro_1020_p", "source_sha256": "3b399b45393bd6decb7e44cf9baa7d270593cf3345e5a4238c8dacf028ad8260", "ja": "はい、お疲れ様でした……って、あのっ！\n社長、何かお話があったんじゃないんですか？", "zh": "是，辛苦了……不对，等等！\n社长，你不是有什么事要跟我说吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_intro_1021_101kot", "source_sha256": "ef89e5349f1057da8ff4eb9ad6b7cec71a54b77677bee8049f246f74eeedd8a2", "ja": "そうですよ、社長！　{$P$}さんは、\nシュークリーム配達員さんじゃないですからね！", "zh": "就是说啊，社长！\n{$P$}先生可不是泡芙外送员喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_intro_1022_president", "source_sha256": "2caae93ae24d8759f4b9f98118d2843f7cf39313668e66c13636128844fbba74", "ja": "おお、そういえばそうだったね！　いや、すまない！\nあまりに美味しくて、つい……。", "zh": "喔喔，这么说起来好像是呢！哎呀，抱歉！\n泡芙实在是太好吃了，我不小心就忘了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_intro_1023_president", "source_sha256": "16f99ee4ab325dcebc56a107b928bca4012b78675c3fa024803583e4e700a223", "ja": "いや、話というのは他でもない。察しのいい君の\nことだから、大体わかっているかもしれないが……。", "zh": "其实我要说的不是别的，\n你这么敏锐也许已经猜出个大概了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_intro_1024_president", "source_sha256": "cef7291bc852a9349faab09af80a7733c44666a6e508ce4efbce4c253a53a546", "ja": "いや、まずは『リコッタ』の公演成功をねぎらわせて\nもらおう。見事にやり遂げてくれたね、君！", "zh": "不，首先要感谢你让『Ricotta』的公演成功。\n你做得真是太棒了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_intro_1025_p", "source_sha256": "8a9d122a14ad4b320311bed3b6e9da25bad7dd3ed58e37510433721b2ccb16ea", "ja": "ありがとうございます。春香のお菓子と優しさが、\nみんなをまとめてくれました。", "zh": "感谢社长的称赞。大家能团结一致，\n都要归功于春香的点心和体贴。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_intro_1026_president", "source_sha256": "35605a623a6566c01fa98f27fb50a88265dc0fb43d413e8358b22086ba8d81ac", "ja": "それと、君のアイドルに対する情熱のたまものだろう。\nいや私も誇らしいよ、はっはっは！", "zh": "还要加上你对偶像的热情，才能获得这种成果吧？\n连我都觉得很骄傲喔，哈哈哈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_intro_1027_101kot", "source_sha256": "da5a40181c0d0a7738e0a9222be5b6ff286899a1209ae2dcb42e610b486c8531", "ja": "本当に、素晴らしい公演でした！\n……ぱくっ、もぐもぐ♪", "zh": "那真的是一场非常棒的公演！\n……（大口咀嚼）♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_intro_1028_p", "source_sha256": "6f6a2d682f644c9e124ecabe3e7dcd9af76fef4f3e3a134d157eef297c6849b8", "ja": "音無さん、まだ食べてたんですね……。", "zh": "音无小姐，你还在吃呀……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_intro_1029_101kot", "source_sha256": "521ba1a58c5cff23d1d3973fa1f2c3a24b179ea524e5e5f8de128d36cba5fcaf", "ja": "はっ。す、すみません、おいしすぎてつい～！\nんぐっ。……あ、どうぞお話を続けてください♪", "zh": "啊，对、对不起，这太好吃了，我忍不住～！\n（吞下）……啊，请你们继续谈吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_intro_1030_president", "source_sha256": "54d0bddc7c88e336439f7a761ec207c20922d363c02948a1a36882fb1bf14e67", "ja": "音無君……。これからいいところなんだから、\n食べるなら、ひとつ静かに頼むよ？", "zh": "音无……我们接下来要谈到重点了，\n拜托你要吃就安静一点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_intro_1031_president", "source_sha256": "a287acec61790ad8ed07336199105349e5cf58358e2c71c30ecde5a7fc749dea", "ja": "うおっほん！　ま、というわけでだ！　君にはさらに、\n新しいシュークリームのプロデュースを頼もうと思う！", "zh": "咳咳！总之就是这样！\n我想拜托你再培育新的泡芙！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_intro_1033_president", "source_sha256": "1dc773adaceda7ca309acb342672c42619733e8e11cf22056d6ac5a280126e78", "ja": "あ、いや違った！　そうではなくてね、コホン。\n新しい、ユニットの！プロデュースを頼みたいと思う！", "zh": "啊，不是，我说错了！不是泡芙，咳咳。\n我想拜托你培育新的团体！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_intro_1034_p", "source_sha256": "2ec459b40579d4dad0a37deb4b2e18759ed545441fff333443458a565e21dc04", "ja": "新しいユニット……！\nやはり、そうでしたか。安心しました！", "zh": "新团体……！\n果然是这样，我放心了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_intro_1035_president", "source_sha256": "6cc1418bd73e1ddf794dffc1aa3c024b67846e9f8c7b7a86af227e7084a8be38", "ja": "うむ！　こんどのユニットは、\n『レジェンドデイズ』と名付けよう！", "zh": "嗯！\n这次的团体就命名为『Legend Days』！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_intro_1036_p", "source_sha256": "68f03c54588e465c17f5cce30ab3bca54a87d55a1e755913bdf34f2ec76c6951", "ja": "『レジェンドデイズ』……迫力のある、\nいい名前ですね。メンバーには誰を？", "zh": "『Legend Days』……真是充满魄力的好名字。\n成员有谁呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_intro_1037_president", "source_sha256": "f37b966170548d1c6af9f37db290b5017faa3f68365d9e1b686bb65d1e2164af", "ja": "私の考えでは、水瀬伊織君、双海亜美君、\n秋月律子君、高槻やよい君……", "zh": "按照我的想法是水濑伊织、双海亚美、\n秋月律子、高槻弥生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_intro_1038_president", "source_sha256": "ce50e9856d10c0ab34df28151278331c417e755f4f1bb0dd0fef7790a242cff9", "ja": "そしてリーダーは、我那覇響君に頼みたいと思って\nいる。彼女達のプロデュース、引き受けてくれるかな？", "zh": "至于队长就拜托我那霸响来担任。\n你愿意接受培育她们的工作吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_intro_1039", "source_sha256": "8b49a8177cb4ca87f2481bdba27846ec0f645415b87befe34cc3a40b2b8eddbd", "ja": "よろこんで！", "zh": "我非常乐意！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_intro_2000_p", "source_sha256": "33bda506142cd19c633db915988fa8aefc4584a01f6539907994e7900386fa23", "ja": "ええ、よろこんで！　今回は、俺とも付き合いの長い\n子ばかりで、あまり心配する必要もなさそうです。", "zh": "是，我很乐意！\n这次的成员都跟我相处了很久，似乎不需要太担心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_intro_2001_p", "source_sha256": "b2b5db6015c573a5f912f9c0a5d3880f4cf7ded1a6e9776ab719153e8de5bd85", "ja": "きっと完成度の高い、洗練されたユニットに\nなるんじゃないでしょうか！", "zh": "她们一定会是一个\n尽善尽美、表现成熟的团体！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_intro_2002_president", "source_sha256": "00858b90e5f01fb8838999e0aa7628209df76c1fbcf36b1cc7ad89248df08a71", "ja": "私もそう思うよ。ユニット名にもあるとおり、\n伝説級のユニットになってくれればと期待している。", "zh": "我也这么想。\n我很期待她们成为名副其实的传说级团体。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_intro_2003_p", "source_sha256": "89f9265afa0c64a991b5297ef5f5bdd496566d7a7ae15bbc9e205d414e6adf37", "ja": "そうですね。彼女達のポテンシャルなら、\n夢ではないかもしれません。", "zh": "是，以她们的资质来说，\n这可能不是梦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_intro_2004_101kot", "source_sha256": "6814116e3c8c7a83ede60d87e88aebb37ded426534e2fac1225d634b99fdb24b", "ja": "ステキな伝説を作れるといいですね！\n私も、ステージを楽しみにしています♪", "zh": "真希望她们能创造出美好的传说！\n我也很期待她们的表演♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_intro_2005_p", "source_sha256": "751235756b76a540241f1e9665ab8aa44f9e51e57d9089703b27a103fefc48e4", "ja": "ありがとうございます、音無さん。俺も全力を\n尽くしますから、期待していてください！", "zh": "谢谢你，音无小姐。\n我也会倾尽全力，请你拭目以待！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_intro_2006_p", "source_sha256": "329c973e116bc1ad029184649a0837da968e2d3dd06cfc67fa952fd4fd650744", "ja": "（確かに『レジェンドデイズ』のメンバーなら、\n今までにない公演を作れる予感がする……）", "zh": "（我确实有种预感，『Legend Days』的成员\n可以打造出史无前例的公演……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0021_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_intro_2007_p", "source_sha256": "b43942c49a5a9d5239aba6340251be10e23162d395a0878232d5c2485455cc6d", "ja": "（よし。彼女達と一緒に、俺も伝説を目指そう！）", "zh": "（好，我也要跟她们一起努力，目标是迈向传说！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
